OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe BBC is normally pretty good at
OL,9,Fmarking anniversaries.  40 years of
OL,10,Fbreakfast TV, 60 years of Doctor Who,
OL,11,F100 years of the BBC itself.  But this
OL,12,FweekendB marks a different anniversary.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe early evening magazine programme
OL,15,FNationwide came to an end on 5th August
OL,16,F1983.
OL,17,
OL,18,FFor such a successful programme, its
OL,19,Fend was unbecoming.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,137,120,200,300,0,100
