OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn its last couple of years, efforts
OL,7,Fwere made to turn it into a much more
OL,8,Fserious programme.B  In came, briefly,
OL,9,FDavid Dimbleby and a clearer focus on
OL,10,Fharder stories.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIn its final months, the budget had
OL,13,Fbeen cut and corporate attention was on
OL,14,Fthe newly launched Breakfast Time.
OL,15,
OL,16,FIts final editions included nostalgic
OL,17,Flooks back but the very last edition
OL,18,Fseemed to go out on a whimper ` despite
OL,19,Fthe return of Frank Bough and a last
OL,20,Flink around the regions to say goodbye.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,137,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13603
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F136A1768739870
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                  G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FYet this was a programme which during
OL,7,Fits 1970s heyday was part of the spine
OL,8,Fof the BBC One schedule.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIt was probably the only time the BBC
OL,11,Fsucceeded in creating a truly popular
OL,12,Fand populist current affairs programme
OL,13,Fwhich somehow appealed to people turned
OL,14,Foff by Panorama and the predecessors of
OL,15,FNewsnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,FAn almost complete archive, albeit not
OL,18,Fof broadcast quality, is believed to
OL,19,Fsurvive.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,137,120,200,300,0,100
