OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis would give a remarkable portrayal
OL,7,Fof 70s Britain.
OL,8,
OL,9,FFrom power cuts, the Three Day Week and
OL,10,Fpolitical turmoil to spacehoppers,
OL,11,Fskateboarding ducks and passing
OL,12,Fcelebrities.
OL,13,
OL,14,FWhen The One Show launched in 2006 it
OL,15,Fwas sometimes described as a successor
OL,16,Fto Nationwide but I would argue the
OL,17,Fcomparison is misleading.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,137,120,200,300,0,100
