OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FNationwide started at a time when the
OL,7,Fearly evening news was just 10 minutes
OL,8,Flong. Longer news programmes, with some
OL,9,Fof the kind of content which was then
OL,10,Fthe preserve of current affairs
OL,11,Fprogrammes, take care of much ofB the
OL,12,Fmore serious side of Nationwide.
OL,13,
OL,14,FAnd, of course, the main presenters of
OL,15,FThe One Show at the moment are not
OL,16,Fjournalists.
OL,17,
OL,18,FTopical television is about far more
OL,19,Fthan traditionalB news and current
OL,20,Faffairs.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
