OL,3,GFEATURES C40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe beauty of Nationwide ` despised as
OL,7,Fit was by its critics ` was that all
OL,8,Fhuman life was there. It is the nearest
OL,9,Fa BBC current affairs programme has
OL,10,Fever come to being people's television.
OL,11,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
